ok - absent config/lane-capacity reports counts and no target
ok - a target yields open lanes, full, and never a negative count
ok - cpu, memory, and disk pressure close every lane and are named
ok - unavailable probes print unknown and do not constrain
ok - a malformed target is reported, not guessed
